  id: S-10
  lines:
  - speaker: "\xC7ift\xE7i Elif"
    text: "Toprak yorgun Osman. G\xFCbre ruhu olmadan bu y\u0131l da sar\u0131 kalacak."
  - speaker: "Bostanc\u0131 Osman"
    text: "Pazardan al\u0131rs\u0131n."
  - speaker: "\xC7ift\xE7i Elif"
    text: "Pazarda sat\u0131lm\u0131yor ki! Hava var, kazan yok. \xC7\u0131ra\u011Fa
      yapt\u0131raca\u011F\u0131m."
